# Build artifacts -- regenerated fresh every time from wheel/src/, never
# need to be (and shouldn't be) tracked in git. This is also what was
# putting the .whl at corruption risk in the first place -- the safest fix
# for a binary file is to not put it through Git at all, not just mark it
# binary and hope every tool in the chain respects that.
wheel/dist/
wheel/build/
wheel/src/*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Power BI Desktop's local editor cache/state for a .pbip project --
# machine- and session-specific (includes a binary cache blob), not part
# of the model definition. Regenerated by Desktop on open; never track it.
**/.pbi/
